Add `extensions.teleport` and `extensions.remote-run` to Kimchi's resource
registry, both enabled by default, and route the two extensions through
`enabledExtensionFactories`. `isRemoteRunEnabled()` also honours the
remote-run resource, so every caller gated on it (ferment and permissions
"run in cloud" choices) goes quiet when the resource is off.

